cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in scientific work, please cite it."
title: "GPU Quantum Interferometry Solver (GQIS)"
authors:
  - family-names: "Ivakhnenko"
    given-names: "Oleh"
version: "0.3.0"
date-released: "2026-11-27"
abstract: "GQIS converts symbolic Lindblad models and general ordinary differential equations into CUDA kernels for large sweeps over parameters and initial conditions, with selectable integrators of fixed and adaptive step size, outputs of the final state and the time average, and optional sampled time evolution."
keywords:
  - quantum interferometry
  - Lindblad master equation
  - ordinary differential equations
  - CUDA
  - GPU
  - SymPy
  - CuPy
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Olegiv95/Gpu-Quantum-Interferometry-Solver"
